1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,727
Welcome to our Early Career Teachers
Professional Learning

2
00:00:07,727 --> 00:00:08,182
Workshop.

3
00:00:08,182 --> 00:00:11,506
Today we're going to explore Autistic
experience and what it

4
00:00:11,506 --> 00:00:13,561
means for access, belonging and

5
00:00:13,561 --> 00:00:16,355
partnership at school. Keep the students
